            "id": 130614,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposta esplicitamente il tipo della variabile <code>fruits</code> come array di stringhe.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fruits: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[] = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Banana&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mango&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>string</code>, seguito da <code>[</code> e infine <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 131189,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come definisci un tipo intersezione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>type C = A | B;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>type C = A &amp; B;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>type C = A AND B;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>type C = A &amp; B;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 131188,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come si chiama il tipo creato?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Person {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Persona</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nome</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Età</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Persona.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 131190,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come si definisce un tipo unione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>type C = A | B;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>type C = A &amp; B;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>type C = A OR B;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>type C = A | B;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
